  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 14.4% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $2.91B (14.4% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/amc-ceo-criticizes-robinhoods-tokenized-stock?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AMC chief criticizes Robinhood\u2019s tokenized stock plan</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tokens/money-mushroom-moved-a-nasdaq-penny-stock-but-its-tokenized-stock-is-a-memecoin-too\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&#x27;Money Mushroom&#x27; Moved A Nasdaq Penny Stock, But Its &#x27;Tokenized Stock&#x27; Is A Memecoin Too</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/04/south-korea-targets-february-2027-rollout-for-full-tokenized-securities-market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">South Korea targets February 2027 rollout for full tokenized securities market</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/04/from-warning-to-listing-uk-s-largest-wealth-platform-opens-access-to-crypto-etns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">From warning to listing: UK\u2019s largest retail investment platform opens access to crypto ETNs</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
